li.p:

  \left[\begin{array}{rrr}
  a \amp b \amp c \\
  d \amp e \amp f \\
  0 \amp 0 \amp 1 \\
  \end{array}\right]
  \threevec{x}{y}{1} =
  \cthreevec{ax+by+c}{dx+ey+f}{1}\text{,}

which shows that

  \begin{alignedat}{2}
  x' \amp {}={} ax+by+c \\
  y' \amp {}={} dx+ey+f\text{.} \\
  \end{alignedat}
